# $\textsf{\color{darkblue}{CQRS - Architecture 1DB - InProgress}}$ 

This repository will explain about CQRS architecture by using technology Asp.Net Core and Angular.
Solution consists of following projects 

1. Entities
2. UseCaseModels or ApplicationModels
3. Commands
4. Queries
5. UseCase or Application
6. Infrastructure
7. Controller

Clean Architecture Dependency travels towards inwards

<br />

# $\textsf{\color{darkblue}{Dependency Layer}}$ 

```nginx

   Entities

   UseCaseModels

   Commands --> Entities
            --> UseCaseModels

   Queries --> Entities
           --> UseCaseModels

   UseCase  --> Entities
            --> UseCaseModels
            --> Commands
            --> Queries

   Infrastructure --> Entities
                  --> UseCase

   Controller --> Refers UseCase only for Composition Root and IApplicationService.
              --> Refers Infrastrucure only for Composition Root.

```

<br />

